    "detailed_description": "Skate to the beat, but don't trip over your feet!<br><br>Skate &amp; Date is a roller derby, rhythm ga(y)me about expressing yourself and falling in love.<br>You play as Maggie, a highschooler on the Rockin' Rollergirls who has a crush on one of her rivals - Patricia.<br>You can play through the Story Mode or kick back in Free Skate mode!<br><br><br><br><strong>Features!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A cute story mode about high school and roller derby<br></li><li> A rhythm game that affects the story depending on what you do!<br></li><li> Choices that rely on your stats (and previous choices)<br></li><li> A Funky Original Soundtrack<br></li><li> Different Difficulty Modes<br></li><li> Free Skate for when you want to practice your groovy moves<br></li><li> Lesbians, harold!!!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Skate to the beat, but don't trip over your feet!<br><br>Skate &amp; Date is a roller derby, rhythm ga(y)me about expressing yourself and falling in love.<br>You play as Maggie, a highschooler on the Rockin' Rollergirls who has a crush on one of her rivals - Patricia.<br>You can play through the Story Mode or kick back in Free Skate mode!<br><br><br><br><strong>Features!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A cute story mode about high school and roller derby<br></li><li> A rhythm game that affects the story depending on what you do!<br></li><li> Choices that rely on your stats (and previous choices)<br></li><li> A Funky Original Soundtrack<br></li><li> Different Difficulty Modes<br></li><li> Free Skate for when you want to practice your groovy moves<br></li><li> Lesbians, harold!!!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Skate &amp; Date is a roller derby, rhythm ga(y)me where you play as Maggie, the lead jammer of the Rockin' Rollergirls! She has a bit of a crush on Patricia \u2013 one of the opponents on the rival team. Your objective: to impress her with your sick roller derby skills!",
